* intuition.library in the C900 dialect of an Amiga fd file, from AROS's
* intuition.conf.  Each function takes IntuitionBase first; the C functions
* are AROS_LH definitions named Intuition_N after their vector.  A function
* that keeps its register list is not implemented.
